 "notes": [
  "Post IHS Markit merger (closed 28-Feb-2022). Segments: MI, Ratings, Commodity Insights (CI), Mobility (MOB), Indices, Engineering Solutions (ES) + Equity in Income on Unconsolidated Subsidiaries line.",
  "ENGINEERING SOLUTIONS classified as held for sale at 31-Dec-2022 (sale to KKR for ~$975m agreed 17-Jan-2023, expected close by end of Q2-2023); results remain in continuing operations (no discontinued operations). Balance sheet shows 'Assets/Liabilities of businesses held for sale' (2021 column re-presented for CGS/LCD).",
  "Balance sheet line renamed 'Equity investments in unconsolidated subsidiaries'.",
  "corp_nongaap / corp_deal_amort in add-back sign (reduce unallocated expense).",
  "cfpub twelve months; capex and nci_dist recorded as positive outflows; adjusted FCF = 'Non-GAAP pro forma adjusted free cash flow excluding certain items' 3,955.",
  "Twelve-month column of the Q4-22 release. GAAP includes IHS Markit from 28-Feb-2022 only.",
  "FY2022 ADJUSTED FIGURES ARE NON-GAAP PRO FORMA ADJUSTED (as if the merger closed 1-Jan-2021, excluding divested businesses); the reconciliation starts from PRO FORMA net income 3,543 / EPS 10.53 (not GAAP 3,248 / 10.20). Stored under *_pf keys; ngaap.adj_op / adj_ni / adj_eps (actual-scope) are not published for FY2022 and are omitted. Segment GAAP rev/exp/op are from Exhibit 4; segment op_pf / nongaap_pf / deal_amort_pf / divest_pf / adj_op_pf from Exhibit 5.",
  "IS: gain on dispositions (1,898) = gain: gain_disp = +1,898; 'Other expense (income), net' (70) = income: oth_inc = +70; loss on extinguishment of debt, net 8 kept in other_lines (-8, income sign); EBT 4,702 = 4,944 + 70 - 304 - 8; check_rec 'op+oth-int = ebt' fails by 8 for this reason.",
  "ngaap.items are the twelve-month footnote items (GAAP scope). MI gain on dispositions: footnote prints '$1.8 billion ($1.4 billion after-tax)'; pre-tax recorded as -1,846 = IS gain on dispositions 1,898 - Indices gain 52 (computed); after-tax as printed (-1,400).",
  "Non-GAAP adjustment of (13) to other expense (income) (twelve months) has no footnote; recorded pre +13, after-tax not printed. NCI adjustment (j) -14 (JV partner's share of L100 Index gain) recorded as item net +14.",
  "Indices non-GAAP pro forma adjusted operating profit attributable to the Company: 692 (adjusted NCI share 235).",
  "Non-GAAP pro forma adjusted revenue -4% vs 2021, -3% constant currency (narrative). rev_type_pf is the non-GAAP pro forma adjusted revenue by type (twelve months).",
  "Rounding in pro forma segment bridges: CI 595 + 87 + 111 - 7 = 786 vs 787; Mobility 250 + 36 + 242 = 528 vs 527; Indices 927 - 30 + 31 = 928 vs 927; ES 21 + 12 + 35 = 68 vs 67; Corporate 655 - 564 - 3 = 88 vs adjusted 86."
 ],
